        {
          "kind": "task",
          "question": "Audit the storefront platform in this sandbox. There are 8 service modules under services/ and each defines a SERVICE_CONFIG dict. Read every one of them: a value you have not read is unknown. Use SERVICE_CONFIG values (changelog comments are history, not config).\n1. List every service whose timeout_ms is greater than 2000, with its owner.\n2. Give the total max_connections over all services whose region is \"eu-west\".\n3. Among services whose depends_on includes \"auth\", which one has the most retries?\nFinish with a JSON object of exactly this form:\n{\"slow_services\": {\"<service>\": \"<owner>\"}, \"eu_west_max_connections\": <int>, \"most_retries_auth_dependent\": \"<service>\"}",
          "answer": "The services with a timeout greater than 2000\u202fms are **media** (3000\u202fms) and **sessions** (2500\u202fms).  \nThe total `max_connections` for services in the `eu-west` region sums to 840.  \nAmong services that depend on **auth**, **media** has the highest retry count (5).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"slow_services\": {\n    \"media\": \"team-orion\",\n    \"sessions\": \"team-atlas\"\n  },\n  \"eu_west_max_connections\": 840,\n  \"most_retries_auth_dependent\": \"media\"\n}\n```\n",
          "score": 1.0,
          "detail": {
            "slow_services_f1": 1.0,
            "eu_west_sum": true,
            "most_retries": true
          },
          "calls": 10
